<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f7; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
    .content { padding: 32px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; }
    .content h2 { color: #667eea; }
    .footer { background: #f4f4f7; padding: 16px 32px; text-align: center; color: #888888; font-size: 12px; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #667eea; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 16px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Hello {{name}},</h2>
      <p>Thank you for joining our platform. We're excited to have you on board!</p>
      <p>You can start exploring the features right away. If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>
      <a href="#" class="btn">Get Started</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} Our Platform. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
